y.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/afe6fdbeabbc882b5923f392af9ee5b8?_a=AQADKdt","num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-05-22T07:27:07.701Z"},{"id":"oyjwfmqXW","title":"In Focus: Sumanth Reddy","url":"https://lambda.blinkit.com/in-focus-sumanth-reddy-79c6c293bda5?source=rss----42df4a1e8725---4","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/in-focus-sumanth-reddy-oyjwfmqxw","summary":"Blinkit Chinthakunta Sumanth Kumar Reddy is SDE 3 at Blinkit. He joined us in March 2021 and has since helped us build a resilient application platform. He currently works as a part of Software Resilience Engineering (SRE) The ability to build resilient software excites him.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/722df705ea79df9d908ee74a2f852fe3","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-03-16T03:21:00.932Z"},{"id":"blHPGNr2H","title":"Make your reports faster: A beginner\u2019s guide to Tableau Optimisation","url":"https://lambda.blinkit.com/make-your-reports-faster-beginners-guide-to-tableau-optimization-b94c4a666466?source=rss----42df4a1e8725---4","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/make-your-reports-faster-a-beginner-s-guide-to-tableau-optimisation-blhpgnr2h","summary":"Learn how to optimize Tableau dashboards for faster performance and generate valuable insights.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/a04e8c3e5353b80904998ddf961628ff?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-03-08T05:41:07.526Z"},{"id":"IiJuyb5Oh","title":"In Focus: Jay Dihenkar","url":"https://lambda.blinkit.com/in-focus-jay-dihenkar-3cd0456a9efa?source=rss----42df4a1e8725---4","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/in-focus-jay-dihenkar-iijuyb5oh","summary":"Jay Dihenkar is a Staff Engineer at Blinkit, working on improving reliability, scalability, observability, and developer productivity. The biggest challenges in quick commerce are logistics infrastructure, talent shortage, and value consciousness. The most remarkable change witnessed at Blinkit was transitioning to quick commerce and delivering items in minutes.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/1966a93c000365327bbf470a4c2e8e9e?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-02-23T03:01:28.687Z"},{"id":"gQdN-ST5T","title":"My journey at Blinkit: A series of epiphanies","url":"https://lambda.blinkit.com/my-journey-at-blinkit-a-series-of-epiphanies-c004c30ad973?source=rss----42df4a1e8725---4","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/my-journey-at-blinkit-a-series-of-epiphanies-gqdn-st5t","summary":"Kumkum Jain Rukmini Bhattacharya has been with Zomato since 2018 and with Blinkit since June 2022. She currently works as the City CEO of Bengaluru and heads growth. She also sheds light on her learnings working with a tech-first ops company.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/454249740927113df1ef60572526eb19","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-12-22T03:25:20.866Z"},{"id":"NjR_8a9Ic","title":"First 6 Months at Blinkit: Drishti Makhija","url":"https://lambda.blinkit.com/first-6-months-at-blinkit-drishti-makhija-3d9088a155aa?source=rss----42df4a1e8725---4","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/first-6-months-at-blinkit-drishti-makhija-njr-8a9ic","summary":"Drishti Makhija Drishti is a Software Developer Engineer (SDE) at Blinkit. She joined Blinkit about six months ago and is now a part of the tech team within the Product Listing and Search pod. In this post, she recounts her journey with Blinkit and the lessons she learned.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/fc27363a4b97f57d5af95c911f7e0d11","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-12-01T03:23:13.761Z"},{"id":"Wh6oDiFMA","title":"How love for food made me participate in HackaNoodle?","url":"https://lambda.blinkit.com/how-love-for-food-made-me-participate-in-hackanoodle-c70c1a7eccbf?source=rss----42df4a1e8725---4","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/how-love-for-food-made-me-participate-in-hackanoodle--wh6odifma","summary":"HackaNoodle is a hackathon powered by Blinkit, with a special focus on women and the trans community. Founder of Zomato was founded because of a pizza craving, Deepinder Goyal had 14 years back.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/db105eb46bddeba233ea63a296cbc5d3","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-11-22T11:00:11.058Z"},{"id":"oARpfox9u","title":"First 9 Months at Blinkit: Ketakii Patni","url":"https://lambda.blinkit.com/first-9-months-at-blinkit-ketakii-patni-af6db3c4f899?source=rss----42df4a1e8725---4","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/first-9-months-at-blinkit-ketakii-patni-oarpfox9u","summary":"Ketakii Patni Patni joined Blinkit as an intern in the Cataloguing and Merchandising Department. She has played a key role in Consumer Search Content ever since. In this post, she walks through her journey of improving search on the app.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/7dbdd8af279aba09e30c017aadcf3d1d","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-11-17T02:24:33.850Z"},{"id":"FUGl6EyeK","title":"In Focus: Avi Singh Raghuwanshi","url":"https://lambda.blinkit.com/in-focus-avi-singh-raghuwanshi-f7ea41be9efa?source=rss----42df4a1e8725---4","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/in-focus-avi-singh-raghuwanshi-fugl6eyek","summary":"Avi Singh Raghuwanshi works as an Associate Product Manager (APM) at Blinkit. He previously worked on upselling and cross selling through product listing pages. His current focus includes improving conversions in Mumbai through targeted assortment and maintaining availability.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/bb41c21d353ff1111dceca8f9c52aff3","num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-11-10T03:22:40.055Z"},{"id":"bHZWcd